<title>HONG KONG: DKB unit Chekiang First Bnk launches FRCD.</title>
<headline>DKB unit Chekiang First Bnk launches FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Commerz (East Asia).</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHEKIANG FIRST BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$500 MLN  COUPON	3MH+50    MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE   PAR	 LAUNCH   31.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3 &amp; 4    CALLS	 YR 3 &amp; 4  REPLIES  15.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    --	    REPAYMENT   BULLET    DENOMS   HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING     --	    SALE LMTS   --	  FREQ     QUARTERLY</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  **	    GOV LAW    HONG KONG  PAY DATE 16.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTES  **THE BORROWER, BASED IN HONG KONG, IS WHOLLY-OWNED BY</p>
<p>	  DAI-ICHI KANGYO BANK.</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS     HK$50 MLN     39BP   ALL-IN  63</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	   HK$25-49 MLN  33BP   ALL-IN  61</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS  SCHRODERS ASIA  BOOKS, DKB ASIA  DOCUMENTATION</p>
<p>		    AND COMMERZ (EAST ASIA)  PUBLICITY &amp; SIGNING.</p>
<p> REFERENCE AND PAYING AGENT   CHEKIANG FIRST BANK</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
